msgstr "Klaim pengeluaran"

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "The employee starts a claim, or it comes back to them"
msgstr "Karyawan memulai klaim, atau klaim dikembalikan kepadanya"

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "The employee sends the claim"
msgstr "Karyawan mengirim klaim"

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "The last approver says yes"
msgstr "Pemberi persetujuan terakhir menyetujui"

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "Every receipt on the claim has been paid"
msgstr "Semua struk pada klaim sudah dibayar"

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "An approver says no"
msgstr "Pemberi persetujuan menolak"

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "Every receipt on the claim is marked approved."
msgstr "Semua struk pada klaim ditandai disetujui."

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"Every receipt is marked refused with the approver’s reason, which the employee sees on their claim."
msgstr ""
"Semua struk ditandai ditolak beserta alasan dari pemberi persetujuan, yang dilihat karyawan pada klaimnya."

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "The employee home shows the employee a “fix and resend” reminder."
msgstr ""
"Beranda karyawan menampilkan pengingat “perbaiki dan kirim ulang” kepada karyawan."

#. module: pb_me_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_me_expense/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"When a claim is sent back or taken back, its receipts can be changed and sent again."
msgstr ""
"Saat klaim dikembalikan atau ditarik kembali, struknya bisa diubah dan dikirim lagi."

